    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch02-14: not-empirically-resolvable, resolvability 0.08";
    dc:description "This is primarily a methodological maxim with self-referential and counterfactual content. Existing historical evidence cannot distinguish necessity from one useful discovery strategy across all possible unknown phenomena.";
