    dc:type "resolution-route/none";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: The universal only-way statement lacks a measurable population of all unknown phenomena and all discovery methods. Historical counterexamples might refute a narrow reading, but no finite analysis can confirm the methodological necessity as stated.";
