    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Discovery histories are selectively documented.", "Systematic, general, and few preconceptions lack objective thresholds.", "Unknown phenomena cannot be sampled before discovery.";
